      "exercise": "52",
      "prompt": "52. 确定进行变形的顺序并化简下列各式：\na) $\\left(\\frac{x}{x+1}+1\\right)\\cdot\\frac{1-x^2}{4x^2-1}$；\nb) $\\left(\\frac{1}{1-y}-y\\right):\\frac{y^2-y+1}{y^2-2y+1}$；\nc) $\\frac{ab+b^2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{3a}{b^3}+\\frac{a+b}{b}$；\nd) $\\frac{x-y}{4y}\\cdot\\frac{8y^2}{x^2-xy}-\\frac{3}{x^2}$；\ne) $1+\\frac{24}{(x-2)^2}\\cdot\\frac{4x-x^2-4}{3(x+6)}$；\nf) $\\left(\\frac{4a}{2-a}-a\\right):\\left(2+\\frac{a^2+4}{a-2}\\right)$。",
